### ============================================================================
### TERRATECH HUB - Pengujian Endpoint REST API Enclosures (VS Code REST Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/enclosures
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/enclosures

### 1. GET Semua Data Enclosure (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json


### 2. GET Satu Data Enclosure dengan ID Valid (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json


### 3. POST Tambah Data Enclosure Valid (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sumatran Mossy Cavern",
  "type": "cloud",
  "temperature": 21.5,
  "humidity": 92,
  "isMistingActive": true,
  "lastMaintenance": "2026-10-07",
  "inhabitants": [
    "Megophrys nasuta",
    "Live Sphagnum Moss",
    "Folsomia candida (Springtail)"
  ]
}


### 4. POST Data Tidak Valid - Uji Validasi DTO class-validator (400 Bad Request)
# - name kurang dari 3 karakter ("AB")
# - type di luar pilihan ('desert' tidak ada di ['amazon','cloud','spiny','peat'])
# - temperature melebihi batas maksimum 40 (55)
# - humidity di luar rentang 0-100 (150)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AB",
  "type": "desert",
  "temperature": 55,
  "humidity": 150,
  "isMistingActive": "bukan-boolean",
  "lastMaintenance": "bukan-tanggal"
}


### 5. POST Nama Duplikat Case-Insensitive - Uji ConflictException (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "amazonian understory",
  "type": "amazon",
  "temperature": 25.0,
  "humidity": 85,
  "isMistingActive": true,
  "lastMaintenance": "2026-10-07"
}


### 6. GET ID Tidak Ada - Uji NotFoundException (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/999
Accept: application/json


### 7. PATCH Perbarui Data Enclosure Berdasarkan ID (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 30.2,
  "humidity": 45,
  "isMistingActive": true
}


### 8. DELETE Hapus Data Enclosure Berdasarkan ID (200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4
Accept: application/json
